EN:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}You sure you shouldn't be sleeping?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
It's still light out, but it's still night,
you know. {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Willst du auch noch nicht schlafen?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
