nicht so aussieht, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Uyuman gerekmiyor mu sence?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
